{
  "_provenance": ["The schema the v0.51.0 release creates: its own migrate() (git show 3b3075d:bff/src/lib/migrate.ts, the v0.51.0 release head) run on a fresh PostgreSQL 16 database, read back from information_schema.", "tables: every public table. columns: every NOT NULL column with no default, per table. v0.51.0 INSERTs a value into each of these, so they are the only required columns a rollback to it can live with. Captured once, 2026-10-02, the way v0.49.0-required-columns.json was (the same read of v0.49.0's migrate() gives that file back exactly); never edit by hand."],
